---
import { CE_DEPLOY_VERSION, CE_DEPLOY_RELEASE_URL } from '../config/release.mjs';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="What's New — CE-Deploy" description="Recent CE-Deploy releases and product improvements."><div class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">What’s new</div><h1>Shipping practical improvements.</h1><p>Highlights from recent CE-Deploy releases. GitHub remains the complete source for release notes.</p><p>Current stable release: <a href={CE_DEPLOY_RELEASE_URL}>CE-Deploy {CE_DEPLOY_VERSION}</a></p></div></div><section><div class="container"><article class="release"><time datetime="2026-09-28">September 28, 2026 · v16.4.1</time><h2>PhonePilot, supported runtime, and reliability fixes</h2><ul><li>Redesigned PhonePilot with focused Control and Diagnose workspaces, live call and SIP diagnostics, screenshot history, structured session events, and privacy-aware evidence exports.</li><li>Strengthened PhonePilot session isolation, command ordering, failure recovery, screenshot validation, truthful stale/unknown states, and Pro or Partner Plus access enforcement.</li><li>Fixed MacroFactory CSV exports, selective device-tag removal, Partner deployment modal lifecycles, and organization action menus.</li><li>Stabilized Environmental Intelligence polling and replaced the animation-heavy default signage with the lightweight Living Building view.</li><li>Updated to Electron 44.4.3, isolated development credentials from production, and moved clipboard operations behind validated main-process handling.</li><li>Added a CE-Deploy-branded browser sign-in confirmation and repaired stable/development telemetry transitions from Private Beta identities.</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases/tag/v16.4.1">Read complete release notes</a></article><article class="release"><time datetime="2026-09-18">September 18, 2026 · v16.4.0</time><h2>Partner Plus and browser-based Webex sign-in</h2><ul><li>Introduced Partner Plus for partners and external administrators managing up to 30 selected customer organizations per computer.</li><li>Extended familiar Commercial cloud device, workspace, configuration, inventory, certificate, phonebook, tag-schema, deployment, and scheduling workflows into customer context.</li><li>Added a separate Partner Plus trial, four-computer activation pool, paid-upgrade and finite-gift support, and membership-owner activation for another day-to-day Webex user.</li><li>Moved interactive Webex sign-in to the default browser for enterprise SSO and passkeys, with explicit account selection on every sign-in.</li><li>Fixed MicrosoftTeams command validation and confirmation dialogs that could stick during their opening animation.</li><li>Updated image-processing and YAML dependencies to address security advisories.</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases/tag/v16.4.0">Read complete release notes</a></article><article class="release"><time datetime="2026-09-11">September 11, 2026 · v16.3.7</time><h2>More reliable workspace updates and activation codes</h2><ul><li>Repaired CSV submission for Shared, Personal, and Device Codes, with a Review Workspaces step before updates or code generation.</li><li>Validates the complete CSV with row-specific errors, reads the latest file edits, and cancels submission if the organization changes during review.</li><li>Corrected Hybrid Calling Email and Hotdesking fields, preserved phone-number and extension formatting, and fixed handling of blank rows and license metadata.</li><li>Verifies Shared workspace updates and reports Personal API acceptance, with clearer activation-code progress, partial results, failures, and history.</li><li>Enabled optional acquisition telemetry in supported stable macOS and Windows builds after disclosure acknowledgment and while sharing is enabled. Settings → Privacy provides controls to disable sharing, reset the installation identity, or request deletion.</li><li>Improved release packaging and uploads to keep installers and update files together, with more reliable Windows file replacement.</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases/tag/v16.3.7">Read complete release notes</a></article><article class="release"><time datetime="2026-09-03">September 3, 2026 · v16.3.6</time><h2>Safer automation and clearer workflow feedback</h2><ul><li>Fixed Workspace CSV filters and added clear feedback for failed exports or no matching workspaces.</li><li>More reliable scheduled jobs with durable creation and cancellation, import validation and approval, and improved job and endpoint history.</li><li>Stronger OAuth reconnect guidance, organization-bound xAPI execution, and validation across Button Inventory and Tag Schema workflows.</li><li>Improved QR image quality, center-image handling, and readability of long banner text.</li><li>Added an acquisition telemetry foundation with disclosure and Settings controls; production transmission was disabled in 16.3.6 pending privacy and release gates.</li><li>Updated Electron and dependencies, with packaged-application verification for macOS and Windows.</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases/tag/v16.3.6">Read complete release notes</a></article><article class="release"><time datetime="2026-08-21">August 21, 2026 · v16.3.5</time><h2>Major reliability and defect remediation</h2><ul><li>More truthful progress, partial-success, stale-data and failure feedback across core workflows.</li><li>Stronger organization, token, OAuth, IPC, proxy and credential lifecycle handling.</li><li>Safer scheduling, cancellation, gateway-timeout verification and organization-bound state.</li><li>Extensive Environmental Intelligence, macro tooling, dashboard, xAPI Forge and QR workflow corrections.</li><li>Seventy numbered fixes backed by a release gate of 1,796 automated tests.</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases/tag/v16.3.5">Read complete release notes</a></article><article class="release"><h2>Every release, in one place</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Browse the full history, download prior versions and review every change in the official release repository.</p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/voipnorm/CE-Deploy/releases">View all releases</a></article></div></section></BaseLayout>
